@startuml
title Holder List — Membership Update inside _update
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

start
:_update(from, to, value);
:super._update(...)  (balances written first);
if (from != address(0) and balanceOf(from) == 0?) then (yes)
  :remove(from)\nemit HolderRemoved;
else (no)
endif
if (to != address(0) and balanceOf(to) != 0?) then (yes)
  :add(to)\nemit HolderAdded;
else (no)
endif
stop
note right
  Holder set = { addr : balanceOf(addr) != 0 }.
  address(0) is never a holder; a zero-value transfer
  to a fresh address does not create one.
end note
@enduml
